Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:01.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,One {\c&H1EB0F2&}experiment.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:02.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two businesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.37,0:00:03.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,No guarantees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:04.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Business one: I'm\Nreaching
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.01,0:00:06.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,out to real companies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:08.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,and trying to win paying\Ncustomers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:11.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,Business two: the\Nsoftware I'm building to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:12.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,run that outreach.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:15.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,If it genuinely helps\Nme, it might become a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:17.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,product for other\Npeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.15,0:00:17.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.81,0:00:19.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,The software has one\Nuser: me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:20.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.87,0:00:24.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.39,0:00:25.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's the {\c&H1EB0F2&}experiment.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:28.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,If the first business\Nworks, the tool earns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:29.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,its place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:32.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,If the tool works, it\Nmight become a second
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:32.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.77,0:00:35.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,Follow along and watch\Nwhether either one does.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:36.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm Andrew.
